# A file dialog (Windows' Open or Save) in front (decision 181): a pill of its
# own sits by it. Clicked, the island is lent to the dialog: put under it as
# it rests (arriving, unseen), it opens the card that picks files (open);
# when that card closes, however it closes, it closes there (leaving) and the
# app takes it home.
# Default tokens: idle pill 160 wide, an expanded card 480. A 1000-wide screen.

scenario: the dialog's pill puts the island under the dialog, where it opens the picking card
screen 1000
restore left
panel timer
panel search picker
picker 300                          -> Idle picking=arriving pill=220 spot=left   # the idle pill, centred on 300
picker-open                         -> Expanded expanded=search picking=open pill=60
picker-moved 600                    -> pill=360                 # the dialog moved
picker-gone                         -> Idle picking=leaving pill=520   # nothing left to give a file to: it closes there
picker-left                         -> Idle picking=no pill=0   # and is back in its place

scenario: with no dialog the island is as ever
panel timer
panel search picker
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer picking=no zone=yes
card search                         -> Expanded expanded=search picking=no   # Search from its button: in the island's own place

scenario: the card closed any way closes there, then the island goes home
screen 1000
panel search picker
picker 300
picker-open
esc                                 -> Idle picking=leaving pill=220
picker-left                         -> picking=no pill=420
picker 300
picker-open
outside                             -> Idle picking=leaving
picker-left
picker 300
picker-open
close-card search                   -> Idle picking=leaving     # a file was given to the dialog
picker-left                         -> picking=no

scenario: under a dialog the card has no top band that closes it
screen 1000
panel search picker
picker 300
picker-open                         -> Expanded zone=no
top-click                           -> Expanded expanded=search picking=open

scenario: the pill takes the island from whatever it showed, and it comes back to that
panel timer keep
panel search picker
start a
click                               -> Expanded expanded=a
picker 400                          -> Compact picking=arriving  # the open card closed: it arrives as a pill
picker-open                         -> Expanded expanded=search
esc                                 -> Compact picking=leaving
picker-left                         -> Compact picking=no
alert ping                          -> Alert
picker 400                          -> Compact picking=arriving

scenario: the dialog going before the card opened: simply home
panel search picker
picker 400                          -> picking=arriving
picker-gone                         -> Idle picking=no
picker-open                         -> Idle picking=no          # too late: nothing opens

scenario: under a dialog at the screen's edge the card stays on the screen
screen 1000
panel search picker
picker 990
picker-open                         -> pill=520

scenario: with no picking card the pill does nothing; nor while the island is hidden
panel timer
picker 400                          -> Idle picking=no
panel search picker
hide
picker 400                          -> Hidden picking=no
show
picker 400
picker-open                         -> Expanded picking=open
hide                                -> Hidden picking=no         # hidden while lent: home, nothing to close

scenario: a critical alert takes the card away, and the island leaves
panel search picker
start a
picker 400
picker-open
alert fire critical                 -> Alert picking=leaving
picker-left                         -> Alert picking=no

scenario: Search open in the island's own place closes with the dialog too
panel search picker
card search                         -> Expanded expanded=search picking=no
picker-moved 300                    -> picking=no
picker-gone                         -> Idle picking=no          # it was picking for that dialog
